WEBVTT

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:30.297
conservative, Republican,

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:32.836
twice-a-week-churchgoing,

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.954
meat-eating family.

00:00:35.996 --> 00:00:38.446
It doesn't take a shrink
to explain how I ended up

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.186
in the field of conflict resolution.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.752
(Laughter)

00:00:42.164 --> 00:00:45.911
Whether I was facilitating dialogues
in Charlottesville or Istanbul

00:00:45.935 --> 00:00:47.158
or Ahmedabad,

00:00:47.182 --> 00:00:49.087
the challenge was always the same:

00:00:50.088 --> 00:00:51.787
despite all odds,

00:00:51.811 --> 00:00:53.353
and with integrity,

00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:56.278
how do you get people
to connect meaningfully,

00:00:56.302 --> 00:00:57.920
to take risks,

00:00:57.944 --> 00:01:00.508
to be changed by their experience?